        "answer": {
          "short": "$5\\times10^0$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{(3\\times10^{-2})^2}{1.8\\times10^{-4}}&=\\frac{9\\times10^{-4}}{1.8\\times10^{-4}}\\\\\\frac{(3\\times10^{-2})^2}{1.8\\times10^{-4}}&=\\frac{9}{1.8}\\times10^{-4-(-4)}\\\\\\frac{(3\\times10^{-2})^2}{1.8\\times10^{-4}}&=5\\times10^0\\end{align*}$$",
